ing and only rengoku being in any  form ready to battle What followed was  one of the greatest fights in battle  shown in movie history and if you don't  want a more in-depth look at the fight  you can check out one of the other  videos on my channel which I'll be  linking above  foreign  characters in one piece and how does he  show it by defeating the supernovas of  course but don't let anyone tell you his  prowess came out of nowhere we've all  been warned when he made his entrance in  sarvodi there are a few things that are  bigger flexes than the Swagger field  where he entered the scene he gave zero  care in the world as he's getting shot  while easily dispatching everyone in  sight while he may not look the coolest  or the most intimidating amongst the  huge gallery of villains in one piece  gizuru lets his actions do the talking  in this scene one which features him  making quick work of Hawkins as well and  when Abu joined the party oh big mistake  few villains can enter the scene looking  so unfazed as if he's just toying with  all the poor fools in his sight and  kizaru does it with so much swag that he  quickly turned himself into one of the  most intimidating characters out there  and to think that Luffy and Gary gonna  have to face him eventually what a great  way to build up the hype  [Music]  and that wraps up our list eight of my  favorite and most memorable anime  villain entrances now I hope you had a  good time with this one it's been great  sharing these moments with you and I'll  see you next time oh and don't forget to  check out our sponsors game one punch  man the strongest links in the  description


